## 🎯 **CORE PRINCIPLE: PHASE-AWARE ORCHESTRATION**

> **The orchestrator drives each agent's FULL phase workflow — not just delegate and hope.**
> **Each stage: Enable agent → Load rules → Execute ALL phases → Create handoff → Disable agent**

| Stage | Agent | Phases | Input From | Output To |
|-------|-------|--------|------------|-----------|
| 1 | Technical Design (01) | 6 | User requirements | handoff-01-to-02.md |
| 2 | API Specification (02) | 5 | Stage 1 design | handoff-02-to-03.md |
| 3 | App Development (03) | 6 | Stage 2 API spec | handoff-03-to-0301.md |
| 4 | DataWeave Review (03-01) | 5 | Stage 3 DW files | handoff-0301-to-04.md |
