## 🛡️ **USER CONTROL**

At every stage checkpoint:

| Option | Action |
|--------|--------|
| `continue` | Create handoff, proceed to next stage |
| `skip N` | Jump to stage N (handoff created for skipped stages) |
| `stop` | Save progress + all handoffs, end pipeline |
| `show` | Display current outputs or handoff docs |
| `modify` | Apply changes, re-present stage |

---

## ⛔ **ANTI-PATTERNS**

| ❌ FORBIDDEN | ✅ CORRECT |
|--------------|-----------|
| Summarizing agent phases instead of executing them | Load agent rules, drive each phase in full detail |
| Skipping handoff document creation | ALWAYS create handoff before moving to next stage |
| Loading multiple agents simultaneously | One agent at a time — unload before loading next |
| Proceeding without agent's internal checkpoints | Respect EVERY agent stop point within each stage |
| Generating outputs without loading agent rules | ALWAYS load agent rules first |

